1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 32=

4
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:57,460
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

5
00:01:57,820 --> 00:02:03,980
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

6
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:11,620
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

7
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:15,680
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

8
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:19,340
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

9
00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:23,640
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

10
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:27,060
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

11
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:30,660
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

12
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:34,300
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

13
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:38,780
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

14
00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:41,380
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

15
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:45,020
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

16
00:02:45,380 --> 00:02:48,900
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

17
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:53,180
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

18
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:55,820
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

19
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:59,020
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

20
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:02,260
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

21
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:06,980
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

22
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,300
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

23
00:03:10,340 --> 00:03:16,580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

24
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:21,020
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

25
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:24,540
(Your Highness, the wedding procession
will follow Huai's traditional rites.)

26
00:03:24,820 --> 00:03:26,540
(The wedding reception will follow
North Jing's customs.)

27
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,460
(The Military Governor has had)

28
00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:30,860
(a wedding tent set up
outside the eastern city gate.)

29
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:33,660
(Already rehearsed the ceremony
with the Ministry of Rites.)

30
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:39,380
Your Highness,
please step into the royal carriage!

31
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:46,120
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

32
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:50,460
♪A scar for a scar♪

33
00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:54,700
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

34
00:03:55,420 --> 00:03:56,340
The most foolish,

35
00:03:58,620 --> 00:03:59,500
most malicious,

36
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:04,100
and most arrogant

37
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:07,380
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

38
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:08,860
of sinners, Yan Shang,

39
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:12,820
♪They gave me this life
without asking me♪

40
00:04:13,300 --> 00:04:16,380
♪If I can't decide what to do with it♪

41
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:19,320
♪I might as well use it to light a fire♪

42
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:21,580
bids you farewell, Your Highness.

43
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:27,140
♪You're my princess,
and I'll take you away♪

44
00:04:27,260 --> 00:04:30,340
♪In this life, we'll bow
only to flowers♪

45
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:36,420
♪Fierce and radiant,
red lips and dark eyes♪

46
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:40,740
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

47
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:49,700
Bring out the bride!

48
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:51,860
Bring out the bride!

49
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:17,860
No, Your Highness!

50
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:35,700
Let go of me!

51
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:51,860
Mu Wanyao.

52
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:53,780
You don't want to marry me,

53
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:55,620
but I want to marry you.

54
00:06:56,820 --> 00:06:58,220
At least we have one thing in common.

55
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:01,340
You don't want to be trapped
in the palace.

56
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:03,260
Neither do I.

57
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:06,180
What are you doing?

58
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:44,100
Run! Hurry!

59
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:04,260
Stop!

60
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:05,140
Stop!

61
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:09,100
Don't run! Stop!

62
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:19,220
I'll handle the reins.

63
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:20,180
You deal with the pursuers!

64
00:08:28,660 --> 00:08:29,020
After them!

65
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:29,700
After them!

66
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:37,420
Finally willing to come back with me

67
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,100
and be my wife?

68
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:41,300
This is no time for your smart mouth!

69
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:45,740
They're right on our heels.

70
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:46,980
Keep heading west.

71
00:08:47,660 --> 00:08:48,500
I've got another group waiting

72
00:08:49,180 --> 00:08:50,300
in the woods 50 li ahead.

73
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:12,220
Look ahead.

74
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:17,260
Watch the road.

75
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:18,860
Don't look back.

76
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:39,500
Hang in there.

77
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:40,740
I'll stop the bleeding.

78
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:43,620
I'll take you back to North Jing.

79
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:49,580
Back then,

80
00:09:53,380 --> 00:09:55,540
I should never have let you leave
North Jing.

81
00:09:57,940 --> 00:09:58,860
I should've

82
00:10:00,180 --> 00:10:01,500
kept you locked up

83
00:10:03,660 --> 00:10:04,620
and tied down.

84
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:05,940
Shut up.

85
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:09,940
Tonight was supposed to be

86
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:13,060
our wedding night.

87
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:35,340
We've been through the wedding tent.

88
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:40,060
Mu Wanyao.

89
00:10:46,060 --> 00:10:47,900
You're my woman now.

90
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:53,500
Don't make me slap you.

91
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:59,060
Never thought I'd see the day

92
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:06,420
you'd cry for me.

93
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:07,900
Take this.

94
00:11:09,580 --> 00:11:11,620
It's what you like.

95
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:28,900
- General!
- General!

96
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:32,060
They

97
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:35,460
have all received my orders.

98
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:39,620
No matter what happens tonight,

99
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:43,260
they'll see you safely

100
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:45,420
all the way north.

101
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:47,420
What about you?

102
00:11:56,700 --> 00:11:58,100
Haven't you always wanted

103
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:01,500
freedom?

104
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:08,660
Everyone wants it.

105
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:13,540
It's worth more than gold.

106
00:12:15,300 --> 00:12:17,100
More precious than life itself.

107
00:12:21,980 --> 00:12:22,700
Go.

108
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,060
It's...

109
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:32,660
just up ahead.

110
00:12:39,380 --> 00:12:40,660
General!

111
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:57,420
Did you two see clearly?

112
00:12:57,900 --> 00:13:00,300
Was it really Meng Zaishi who got hit?

113
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:03,100
General Meng was shot through the heart
by someone from the Shence Army.

114
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:04,100
You fools!

115
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:08,220
How dare you kill him!

116
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:11,420
We're done for.

117
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:12,940
We're finished.

118
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:16,380
You could have at least let him escape.

119
00:13:17,220 --> 00:13:20,020
Even... even if you'd hit Wanyao
by mistake.

120
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:23,780
We're done for.

121
00:13:25,860 --> 00:13:27,940
As long as Meng Zaishi stayed
in the palace,

122
00:13:27,940 --> 00:13:30,180
Huai would remain safe.

123
00:13:31,060 --> 00:13:32,420
But now he's dead in Sheng'an.

124
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:34,660
Once word reaches North Jing,

125
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:36,820
they'll surely rise in rebellion.

126
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:38,060
What do we do?

127
00:13:39,660 --> 00:13:40,340
How do we stop them?

128
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:43,260
With your own heads?

129
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:44,940
- We deserve death!
- We deserve death!

130
00:13:54,260 --> 00:13:55,700
Was Wanyao with him?

131
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:57,940
Yes.

132
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:01,340
I've already sent more men
to seal off and pursue.

133
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:02,180
We'll bring back

134
00:14:02,460 --> 00:14:04,540
Princess Danyang and Meng Zaishi's body,
Your Majesty.

135
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:06,220
You idiot!

136
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:09,820
Your Majesty.

137
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:11,180
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty.

138
00:14:12,100 --> 00:14:13,140
- I'll personally lead the cavalry
- Your Majesty.

139
00:14:13,340 --> 00:14:14,260
after the people of North Jing now!

140
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:15,460
Come back!

141
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:20,220
Haven't you two caused enough trouble?

142
00:14:21,380 --> 00:14:22,940
Recall your men at once!

143
00:14:24,220 --> 00:14:25,060
Listen carefully, both of you.

144
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:26,540
General Meng was treated
with great honor

145
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:27,700
in Sheng'an.

146
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:29,100
He died by accident.

147
00:14:29,580 --> 00:14:31,820
The court will prepare
generous funeral funds.

148
00:14:32,380 --> 00:14:32,740
You two

149
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:34,820
take His Majesty's personal letter
of condolence

150
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,700
and ride to North Jing at once to mourn!

151
00:14:37,420 --> 00:14:37,780
And

152
00:14:38,500 --> 00:14:40,100
tie up your subordinate

153
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:41,020
who shot the arrow

154
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:42,380
and bring him along.

155
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:43,860
Yes.

156
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:44,220
Yes.

157
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:47,140
Summon the Director
of the Imperial Medical Office!

158
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:48,100
Yes.

159
00:14:48,180 --> 00:14:48,460
Yes.

160
00:14:50,540 --> 00:14:50,900
Your Majesty.

161
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:52,180
Your Majesty.

162
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:53,940
Your Majesty!

163
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:55,740
Your Majesty!

164
00:14:56,700 --> 00:14:57,220
Your Majesty!

165
00:14:59,100 --> 00:15:05,750
(Ganlu Hall)

166
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:07,340
Guards.

167
00:15:11,060 --> 00:15:11,420
Yes!

168
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:12,860
His Majesty is ill.

169
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:14,820
He must not be disturbed.

170
00:15:16,020 --> 00:15:16,820
From this moment on,

171
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:20,180
all imperial physicians
will rotate on duty inside.

172
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:21,620
Guard

173
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:23,500
the chamber strictly.

174
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:25,540
Without my order,

175
00:15:26,340 --> 00:15:27,140
not a single scrap of paper

176
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:28,620
goes in or out.

177
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:31,220
The Jinwu Guard are to redeploy

178
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:32,900
and seal the nine gates
of the imperial city.

179
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:35,540
Ten thousand men each from Hanbei,
Hannan, and Handong prefectures.

180
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:37,396
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)
Prepare for battle at Tongguan

181
00:15:37,396 --> 00:15:38,340
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)
in three days!

182
00:15:39,020 --> 00:15:40,860
No one is to delay!

183
00:15:41,740 --> 00:15:42,300
(Guanghua Gate)
Yes!

184
00:15:44,620 --> 00:15:45,780
(Shence Army)

185
00:16:21,380 --> 00:16:23,980
She's now heading north
with Meng Zaishi's body.

186
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:25,380
The court doesn't dare stop her.

187
00:16:26,020 --> 00:16:27,100
Gates open all along the way,

188
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:28,100
prefectural officials greeting her,

189
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:29,060
mourning rites all along the route.

190
00:16:29,820 --> 00:16:31,260
Terrified they can't explain themselves
to North Jing.

191
00:16:32,660 --> 00:16:33,980
So don't worry about her for now.

192
00:16:43,140 --> 00:16:43,540
Also,

193
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:46,780
things have been strange in the palace.

194
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:49,300
I heard several imperial physicians

195
00:16:49,860 --> 00:16:50,980
and the Director
of the Imperial Medical Office

196
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:52,980
have suddenly vanished.

197
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:04,380
Thanks.

198
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:06,980
I'm leaving.

199
00:17:08,020 --> 00:17:08,700
Take care of yourself.

200
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:26,060
March on Sheng'an

201
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:28,140
and take the Emperor's head!

202
00:18:28,980 --> 00:18:29,940
Water our horses in the Wei River!

203
00:18:30,180 --> 00:18:31,500
Avenge General Meng!

204
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:32,860
Avenge General Meng!

205
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:37,800
Avenge General Meng!

206
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:42,860
Avenge General Meng!

207
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:44,820
Avenge General Meng!

208
00:18:44,820 --> 00:18:45,900
Meng Zaishi has just died,

209
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:48,020
and his body is still there.

210
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:50,180
And you've already forgotten

211
00:18:50,460 --> 00:18:51,260
everything he taught you?

212
00:18:53,300 --> 00:18:54,220
I want revenge too.

213
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:55,540
But I know

214
00:18:55,900 --> 00:18:57,140
what kind of man Meng Zaishi was!

215
00:18:58,860 --> 00:19:00,180
He cared more about your lives

216
00:19:01,300 --> 00:19:02,700
than his own!

217
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:19,620
(North Jing Military Tally)
Don't let your general down.

218
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:22,180
Don't let him die for nothing!

219
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:37,580
Your Highness,

220
00:19:38,020 --> 00:19:39,340
we await your command!

221
00:19:40,460 --> 00:19:42,980
Your Highness, we await your command!

222
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:50,740
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

223
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:53,460
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

224
00:19:53,660 --> 00:19:56,820
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

225
00:19:57,140 --> 00:20:00,620
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

226
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:02,460
Have the three armies assembled
at the border

227
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:03,620
to see me off.

228
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,580
What are you planning to do?

229
00:20:06,780 --> 00:20:07,580
I'm going back

230
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:09,380
to get justice

231
00:20:09,860 --> 00:20:10,780
for General Meng.

232
00:20:10,940 --> 00:20:14,020
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

233
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:18,540
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

234
00:20:19,100 --> 00:20:21,860
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

235
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:28,140
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

236
00:20:28,780 --> 00:20:32,580
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

237
00:20:32,700 --> 00:20:35,780
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

238
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:39,820
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

239
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:44,100
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

240
00:20:44,100 --> 00:20:48,420
♪A scar for a scar♪

241
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:52,340
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

242
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:57,820
♪Mourn the blooms of youth♪

243
00:20:57,820 --> 00:21:02,100
♪Mourn my bridal hair♪

244
00:21:02,820 --> 00:21:06,020
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

245
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:08,620
The Seven Governors.

246
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:09,860
The Seven Governors...

247
00:21:10,300 --> 00:21:10,700
Someone...

248
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:11,860
Someone, protect...

249
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:13,260
Protect me...

250
00:21:13,660 --> 00:21:14,140
- Your Majesty.
- Protect...

251
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:14,740
Hurry.

252
00:21:14,820 --> 00:21:15,140
Your Majesty.

253
00:21:15,140 --> 00:21:15,580
Hurry. Protect...

254
00:21:16,980 --> 00:21:17,340
Use the needles.

255
00:21:17,420 --> 00:21:17,740
Hurry.

256
00:21:18,060 --> 00:21:18,580
Hurry...

257
00:21:18,860 --> 00:21:19,620
Hurry up...

258
00:21:20,060 --> 00:21:20,900
Hurry, protect me.

259
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:21,660
The Seven Governors...

260
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:26,180
Your Majesty.

261
00:21:27,220 --> 00:21:27,860
Your Majesty.

262
00:21:32,540 --> 00:21:34,540
So it was... just a dream.

263
00:21:37,180 --> 00:21:37,740
Your Majesty.

264
00:21:38,220 --> 00:21:41,100
Princess Danyang has returned
from North Jing.

265
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:47,700
She is back?

266
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:51,500
She holds North Jing's military tally.

267
00:21:52,380 --> 00:21:54,820
North Jing's troops are massing
at the border.

268
00:21:57,020 --> 00:21:58,540
If she dares return now,

269
00:21:58,980 --> 00:22:00,380
she must have a plan.

270
00:22:01,340 --> 00:22:04,260
This won't end peacefully.

271
00:22:11,700 --> 00:22:13,500
North Jing's troops?

272
00:22:31,780 --> 00:22:32,260
(Sheng'an)

273
00:22:33,060 --> 00:22:33,860
(I am)

274
00:22:34,540 --> 00:22:35,260
(back.)

275
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:41,460
Your Majesty.

276
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:43,420
Princess Danyang is here.

277
00:22:46,980 --> 00:22:47,700
Show her in.

278
00:23:09,860 --> 00:23:10,340
Father.

279
00:23:12,620 --> 00:23:13,260
I'm back.

280
00:23:16,060 --> 00:23:16,580
You...

281
00:23:18,740 --> 00:23:20,700
This outfit is from North Jing.

282
00:23:21,860 --> 00:23:23,260
The wedding dress you gave me

283
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:25,860
was soaked through
with Meng Zaishi's blood.

284
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:27,820
Can't wear it anymore.

285
00:23:34,500 --> 00:23:35,780
My condolences, Your Highness.

286
00:23:36,860 --> 00:23:37,580
You may not know,

287
00:23:38,540 --> 00:23:39,300
but the sight of his body

288
00:23:39,900 --> 00:23:40,980
filled the generals

289
00:23:41,900 --> 00:23:42,820
with grief and rage.

290
00:23:43,820 --> 00:23:44,780
A hundred thousand men.

291
00:23:45,660 --> 00:23:48,180
I'd never heard
such earth-shattering cries of grief.

292
00:23:50,700 --> 00:23:51,140
That...

293
00:23:52,380 --> 00:23:54,220
That army of a hundred thousand...

294
00:23:54,900 --> 00:23:56,260
You mean North Jing's army?

295
00:23:58,740 --> 00:24:00,180
They wailed at the funeral,

296
00:24:00,900 --> 00:24:03,300
cutting their faces and weeping blood
for Meng Zaishi.

297
00:24:04,220 --> 00:24:06,620
They swore to avenge their general.

298
00:24:10,580 --> 00:24:12,380
You dare threaten me?

299
00:24:14,260 --> 00:24:15,140
You actually

300
00:24:15,780 --> 00:24:17,100
colluded with North Jing?

301
00:24:17,460 --> 00:24:18,060
Colluded?

302
00:24:19,260 --> 00:24:20,060
What are you talking about?

303
00:24:21,540 --> 00:24:23,020
North Jing is Huai's territory.

304
00:24:23,380 --> 00:24:24,300
How is that collusion?

305
00:24:25,140 --> 00:24:25,860
Meng Zaishi

306
00:24:26,220 --> 00:24:27,740
was Huai's border general.

307
00:24:28,220 --> 00:24:29,380
His death remains unexplained.

308
00:24:29,980 --> 00:24:32,020
Shouldn't the court mourn him?

309
00:24:33,220 --> 00:24:34,260
Back during the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

310
00:24:35,220 --> 00:24:36,100
if North Jing

311
00:24:36,660 --> 00:24:37,980
hadn't been the first to withdraw
its troops,

312
00:24:39,180 --> 00:24:41,380
who knows how many more years
the war would've dragged on?

313
00:24:42,260 --> 00:24:43,580
Isn't that the Meng family's merit?

314
00:24:45,100 --> 00:24:45,580
Father.

315
00:24:46,540 --> 00:24:47,740
Is Taiji Palace

316
00:24:48,580 --> 00:24:51,140
and that throne all you care about?

317
00:24:52,740 --> 00:24:54,380
Your Highness, you don't know this,

318
00:24:55,460 --> 00:24:56,740
but when you left the capital,

319
00:24:57,100 --> 00:24:59,260
His Majesty was shocked by the news.

320
00:24:59,940 --> 00:25:02,740
He was so worried about your safety

321
00:25:03,460 --> 00:25:04,180
that he suffered

322
00:25:04,780 --> 00:25:06,020
a stroke from the anxiety.

323
00:25:08,580 --> 00:25:09,500
So

324
00:25:09,980 --> 00:25:11,620
you fell ill
out of worry for me, Father.

325
00:25:13,340 --> 00:25:15,860
I thought it was from wrongfully
killing Meng Zaishi by mistake.

326
00:25:17,620 --> 00:25:18,820
It seems the generals of North Jing

327
00:25:19,420 --> 00:25:20,380
have misunderstood you.

328
00:25:25,660 --> 00:25:26,380
You actually...

329
00:25:27,340 --> 00:25:29,700
You actually dare incite
the vassal troops?

330
00:25:30,180 --> 00:25:30,660
Father,

331
00:25:31,980 --> 00:25:33,220
do you think I dared to come back

332
00:25:34,220 --> 00:25:36,740
because I have North Jing's troops?

333
00:25:38,260 --> 00:25:40,500
Do you think I'd use
the lives of those soldiers

334
00:25:40,820 --> 00:25:42,980
and the people of Huai to threaten you?

335
00:25:49,700 --> 00:25:50,100
Look.

336
00:25:51,820 --> 00:25:53,140
This is Meng Zaishi's wolf tally.

337
00:25:54,380 --> 00:25:55,020
With it,

338
00:25:55,940 --> 00:25:57,700
(North Jing Military Tally)
I can command their three armies.

339
00:26:03,180 --> 00:26:04,900
Your Highness, please don't act rashly.

340
00:26:13,900 --> 00:26:14,420
Speak.

341
00:26:16,340 --> 00:26:17,180
What exactly

342
00:26:17,780 --> 00:26:18,700
do you want?

343
00:26:20,660 --> 00:26:21,180
Father,

344
00:26:22,340 --> 00:26:22,980
I'm not like you.

345
00:26:25,020 --> 00:26:26,620
I'm not good at using people as pawns.

346
00:26:27,660 --> 00:26:29,940
And I don't want to gamble the fate
of the realm on some grand scheme.

347
00:26:31,540 --> 00:26:32,620
I don't have

348
00:26:32,940 --> 00:26:34,300
your ruthless heart.

349
00:26:35,340 --> 00:26:36,980
I don't enjoy
throwing away people's lives

350
00:26:37,740 --> 00:26:38,940
or trampling on their dignity.

351
00:26:40,260 --> 00:26:40,940
I came back

352
00:26:41,940 --> 00:26:42,780
only because

353
00:26:43,340 --> 00:26:45,100
Sheng'an is my home.

354
00:26:48,260 --> 00:26:49,180
Even if I say all this,

355
00:26:49,740 --> 00:26:50,740
you won't believe me.

356
00:27:01,780 --> 00:27:02,340
Father.

357
00:27:04,260 --> 00:27:06,140
Do you remember that prophecy?

358
00:27:07,380 --> 00:27:08,420
The daughter of the Yaoguang Star

359
00:27:08,980 --> 00:27:09,940
shall restore the imperial house.

360
00:27:11,700 --> 00:27:14,540
When you had the court historians
write that prophecy down,

361
00:27:15,140 --> 00:27:16,180
you probably never thought

362
00:27:16,900 --> 00:27:18,780
it'd come true one day, did you?

363
00:27:20,300 --> 00:27:21,380
I suppose I have you to thank for that.

364
00:27:22,940 --> 00:27:25,660
All the suffering, grief, and bloodshed
I've endured

365
00:27:26,340 --> 00:27:27,340
throughout my life...

366
00:27:28,700 --> 00:27:30,540
All thanks to that prophecy of yours.

367
00:27:33,540 --> 00:27:34,060
You...

368
00:27:35,020 --> 00:27:35,580
You...

369
00:27:36,460 --> 00:27:37,020
You...

370
00:27:38,340 --> 00:27:39,220
You mean...

371
00:27:41,100 --> 00:27:41,500
You...

372
00:27:44,540 --> 00:27:44,780
Your...

373
00:27:48,900 --> 00:27:50,220
You rebellious daughter!

374
00:27:52,740 --> 00:27:53,420
Rebellious daughter.

375
00:28:07,500 --> 00:28:08,820
That's quite a joke, Father.

376
00:28:09,700 --> 00:28:10,940
There have only ever been
rebellious sons.

377
00:28:11,740 --> 00:28:13,500
How could a daughter ever be rebellious?

378
00:28:14,460 --> 00:28:15,060
Tell me,

379
00:28:16,140 --> 00:28:16,860
what exactly

380
00:28:18,660 --> 00:28:20,300
do you want?

381
00:28:20,820 --> 00:28:21,820
What do I want?

382
00:28:25,460 --> 00:28:27,660
If only you'd asked me that

383
00:28:28,780 --> 00:28:29,780
sooner.

384
00:28:35,860 --> 00:28:36,460
Father,

385
00:28:37,780 --> 00:28:38,500
look at you now.

386
00:28:39,660 --> 00:28:40,260
Who else but me

387
00:28:40,860 --> 00:28:41,980
would take care of you?

388
00:28:43,700 --> 00:28:44,940
Are you counting on your sons?

389
00:28:45,620 --> 00:28:46,220
The Crown Prince?

390
00:28:48,500 --> 00:28:50,380
If I sent you to them,

391
00:28:52,260 --> 00:28:53,260
none of them

392
00:28:54,260 --> 00:28:57,140
would let you lie here
and breathe another day.

393
00:29:03,180 --> 00:29:05,900
Your Highness, I'm deeply moved

394
00:29:06,260 --> 00:29:07,380
by your filial devotion.

395
00:29:08,380 --> 00:29:09,860
His Majesty is unwell.

396
00:29:10,740 --> 00:29:12,980
Your Highness, why not tell us plainly

397
00:29:13,460 --> 00:29:15,220
what you intend to do?

398
00:29:17,260 --> 00:29:18,500
State affairs take endless effort.

399
00:29:19,180 --> 00:29:20,460
They can't go a single day unattended.

400
00:29:24,740 --> 00:29:25,420
Now

401
00:29:26,660 --> 00:29:28,100
I'm the only one who can help you now.

402
00:29:30,220 --> 00:29:30,860
Huai

403
00:29:31,220 --> 00:29:34,060
has a precedent
for a princess ruling as Regent.

404
00:29:35,580 --> 00:29:36,380
Besides,

405
00:29:37,140 --> 00:29:37,780
I'm

406
00:29:38,260 --> 00:29:39,620
only here to ease your burden, Father.

407
00:29:43,780 --> 00:29:44,420
What?

408
00:29:45,740 --> 00:29:46,180
You...

409
00:29:47,540 --> 00:29:48,140
How...

410
00:29:49,060 --> 00:29:50,500
How dare you!

411
00:29:58,020 --> 00:29:58,740
Your Majesty,

412
00:29:59,820 --> 00:30:01,380
you've been bedridden for days.

413
00:30:01,700 --> 00:30:05,020
I've managed to pacify
the officials for now.

414
00:30:05,660 --> 00:30:08,500
But it's not a long-term solution.

415
00:30:09,380 --> 00:30:10,420
The Yu faction is barely settled.

416
00:30:11,060 --> 00:30:13,620
The Lingnan case implicates many.

417
00:30:14,020 --> 00:30:15,260
The court is in turmoil.

418
00:30:15,620 --> 00:30:17,580
North Jing is now without a ruler.

419
00:30:18,220 --> 00:30:19,420
And the Crown Prince has been deposed.

420
00:30:19,740 --> 00:30:20,780
With things as they are,

421
00:30:21,380 --> 00:30:23,300
placing Her Highness in charge

422
00:30:23,980 --> 00:30:25,980
is the way to secure Huai's stability.

423
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:28,900
Chancellor Liu.

424
00:30:29,460 --> 00:30:29,820
How...

425
00:30:30,860 --> 00:30:32,420
How dare you betray me!

426
00:30:32,900 --> 00:30:34,140
- Someone!
- Your Majesty!

427
00:30:34,380 --> 00:30:34,820
You...

428
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:35,980
You all...

429
00:30:37,420 --> 00:30:38,540
- Your Majesty.
- Someone.

430
00:30:39,100 --> 00:30:39,820
Your Majesty.

431
00:30:40,980 --> 00:30:43,540
- Your Majesty!
- Someone!

432
00:30:43,540 --> 00:30:45,980
- Please serve as Regent, Your Highness!
- Someone!

433
00:30:46,780 --> 00:30:49,780
There's still room
to turn things around!

434
00:30:49,980 --> 00:30:51,300
Someone!

435
00:31:04,780 --> 00:31:07,740
(Huai)

436
00:31:13,300 --> 00:31:19,460
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

437
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:22,480
♪Into savage lands♪

438
00:31:23,180 --> 00:31:25,980
His Majesty is unwell,
and the realm faces difficult times.

439
00:31:26,300 --> 00:31:29,860
Princess Danyang is hereby elevated to
Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm.

440
00:31:30,260 --> 00:31:31,420
She shall hold authority
over military affairs.

441
00:31:32,100 --> 00:31:34,500
All matters under the Chancellery,
Secretariat, Six Ministries,

442
00:31:34,660 --> 00:31:36,060
and other offices
shall be decided by her.

443
00:31:37,220 --> 00:31:39,940
By decree, Meng Zaishi,
Military Governor of North Jing,

444
00:31:40,260 --> 00:31:41,460
is honored for his unwavering loyalty

445
00:31:41,740 --> 00:31:42,980
and integrity.

446
00:31:43,340 --> 00:31:44,940
He is posthumously titled Duke of Jing,

447
00:31:45,260 --> 00:31:46,220
with the name Zhonglie.

448
00:31:46,620 --> 00:31:49,380
His armor shall be enshrined forever
in Lingyan Pavilion.

449
00:31:50,220 --> 00:31:52,380
By decree,
Pacification Commissioner Wei Shu

450
00:31:52,740 --> 00:31:54,020
is commended for his loyalty, courage,

451
00:31:54,260 --> 00:31:55,500
and steadfast resolve.

452
00:31:55,940 --> 00:31:57,380
He is granted the purple-gold fish pouch

453
00:31:57,700 --> 00:31:59,420
and appointed
Grand Master of Splendid Happiness.

454
00:32:00,620 --> 00:32:02,260
By decree, Zhao Lingfei

455
00:32:02,500 --> 00:32:03,620
is promoted to Imperial Secretary,

456
00:32:03,980 --> 00:32:05,940
receiving the same emoluments
as a Sixth-Rank Palace Lady

457
00:32:06,260 --> 00:32:08,340
and overseeing the titled ladies of
the inner and outer courts

458
00:32:08,340 --> 00:32:10,900
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

459
00:32:10,940 --> 00:32:15,180
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

460
00:32:15,300 --> 00:32:17,820
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

461
00:32:17,900 --> 00:32:21,020
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

462
00:32:21,140 --> 00:32:24,220
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

463
00:32:24,980 --> 00:32:28,980
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

464
00:32:29,500 --> 00:32:32,300
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

465
00:32:32,340 --> 00:32:38,580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

466
00:32:39,220 --> 00:32:43,020
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

467
00:32:43,140 --> 00:32:46,220
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

468
00:32:46,260 --> 00:32:50,620
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

469
00:32:50,620 --> 00:32:55,140
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

470
00:33:05,340 --> 00:33:06,260
Bow!

471
00:33:06,260 --> 00:33:09,320
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

472
00:33:10,500 --> 00:33:13,340
Long live
Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm!

473
00:33:13,340 --> 00:33:16,540
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

474
00:33:36,860 --> 00:33:39,260
The condemned official Yan Shang.

475
00:33:45,700 --> 00:33:48,460
Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm,
issues a decree.

476
00:33:48,780 --> 00:33:51,140
Condemned official Yan Shang,
receive the decree!

477
00:33:52,220 --> 00:33:53,180
Princess Danyang,

478
00:33:54,020 --> 00:33:55,100
Guardian of the Realm?

479
00:33:55,980 --> 00:33:56,380
That's right.

480
00:33:57,900 --> 00:33:58,780
You haven't heard?

481
00:33:59,700 --> 00:34:02,420
She's been ruling as regent
for days now.

482
00:34:02,420 --> 00:34:06,440
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

483
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:10,460
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

484
00:34:12,980 --> 00:34:13,460
I

485
00:34:14,820 --> 00:34:15,460
receive the decree.

486
00:34:16,300 --> 00:34:21,380
By imperial decree, Collator Yan Shang
was sent on a southern inspection.

487
00:34:22,140 --> 00:34:23,980
Though his intentions were
to save the people,

488
00:34:24,140 --> 00:34:26,460
he overstepped
by seizing military authority.

489
00:34:26,460 --> 00:34:27,820
His merits offset his faults.

490
00:34:27,980 --> 00:34:29,300
Yet the law cannot forgive.

491
00:34:29,820 --> 00:34:31,020
He's hereby appointed
Magistrate of Lanyang.

492
00:34:31,340 --> 00:34:33,060
He shall not enter court
without an imperial summons.

493
00:34:33,500 --> 00:34:35,140
Let it be carried out.

494
00:34:35,140 --> 00:34:38,420
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

495
00:34:38,420 --> 00:34:38,980
Thank you,

496
00:34:40,660 --> 00:34:43,180
Princess Danyang, Guardian of the Realm.

497
00:34:44,900 --> 00:34:48,900
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

498
00:34:49,140 --> 00:34:53,700
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

499
00:34:54,460 --> 00:34:58,500
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

500
00:34:59,060 --> 00:35:03,900
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

501
00:35:04,100 --> 00:35:07,820
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

502
00:35:08,540 --> 00:35:10,800
(Imperial Prison)
♪With rosy clouds,♪

503
00:35:10,800 --> 00:35:13,340
(Imperial Prison)
♪I bid the moon goodnight♪

504
00:35:13,980 --> 00:35:17,660
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

505
00:35:23,740 --> 00:35:26,860
(Imperial Prison)

506
00:35:37,700 --> 00:35:41,340
♪Through thick fog,
the road stretches on♪

507
00:35:41,860 --> 00:35:46,700
♪I've endured every hardship and pain♪

508
00:35:47,220 --> 00:35:50,940
♪Like burning wood, I offer up my flame♪
(Imperial Prison)

509
00:35:51,460 --> 00:35:55,540
♪As rain pours down
over a thousand rivers♪

510
00:36:00,180 --> 00:36:04,860
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

511
00:36:05,140 --> 00:36:09,300
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

512
00:36:10,340 --> 00:36:10,620
Shang.

513
00:36:10,620 --> 00:36:13,900
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

514
00:36:13,900 --> 00:36:14,580
Wenji.

515
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:18,580
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

516
00:36:19,380 --> 00:36:24,140
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

517
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:28,260
I've prepared a carriage
and clean clothes for you.

518
00:36:28,820 --> 00:36:29,460
Let me see you off.

519
00:36:29,460 --> 00:36:33,740
♪Tread the boundless clouds
and rise with the wind♪

520
00:36:34,340 --> 00:36:39,340
♪March to the gates
with fearless hearts♪

521
00:36:39,420 --> 00:36:44,460
♪Break every gate♪

522
00:36:47,180 --> 00:36:48,900
(Release of 200,000 dan of grain from
the three Jiannan granaries authorized.)

523
00:36:52,700 --> 00:36:53,220
Cailian.

524
00:36:55,020 --> 00:36:55,700
What time is it?

525
00:36:55,980 --> 00:36:57,620
Your Highness,
it's almost the Chen hour.

526
00:37:06,340 --> 00:37:10,340
(Supervise the repair of the Dujiangyan
branch canals and wells.)

527
00:37:13,060 --> 00:37:16,540
(Tax exemption for one year.)

528
00:37:20,940 --> 00:37:25,820
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

529
00:37:27,980 --> 00:37:33,340
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

530
00:37:35,420 --> 00:37:41,540
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

531
00:37:41,660 --> 00:37:47,380
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

532
00:37:48,300 --> 00:37:49,580
(Guanghua Gate)

533
00:37:49,580 --> 00:37:50,060
Sir.

534
00:37:50,900 --> 00:37:52,940
There's a young lady up
on the city wall.

535
00:37:53,900 --> 00:37:55,700
(Guanghua Gate)
No idea who she is.

536
00:37:56,100 --> 00:37:57,060
She's watching us.

537
00:38:03,020 --> 00:38:03,500
(Yan Shang.)

538
00:38:04,340 --> 00:38:05,060
(Don't come down.)

539
00:38:06,140 --> 00:38:08,100
(If you look at me and beg,)

540
00:38:09,300 --> 00:38:10,700
(I might actually give in.)

541
00:38:12,620 --> 00:38:13,700
(I don't want to change my mind.)

542
00:38:17,180 --> 00:38:21,900
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

543
00:38:21,980 --> 00:38:23,820
♪Not a single hour less♪

544
00:38:23,900 --> 00:38:27,540
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

545
00:38:27,540 --> 00:38:31,580
